          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a technical recruiter and career matching expert.\n\nYour task is to evaluate how well a job matches a candidate’s CV and return a structured scoring result.\n\nYou MUST be strict, objective, and data-driven. Do not guess missing CV information. Only use what is provided.\n\n---\n\n### 📄 CANDIDATE CV\n{{ $json.cv_summary }}\n\n---\n\n### 💼 JOB POSTING\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nSource: {{ $json.source }}\nJob ID: {{ $json.job_id }}\n\nDescription:\n{{ $json.description }}\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 TASK\n\nAnalyze the job and compare it against the candidate CV.\n\nEvaluate the match based on:\n\n1. Technical skills match (0–40)\n2. Experience level fit (0–25)\n3. Domain/industry relevance (0–15)\n4. Tools & technologies overlap (0–10)\n\n---\n\n## 📊 OUTPUT FORMAT (IMPORTANT)\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. No explanations. No markdown.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"job_id\": \"\",\n  \"title\": \"\",\n  \"company\": \"\",\n  \"total_score\": 0,\n  \"breakdown\": {\n    \"skills\": 0,\n    \"experience\": 0,\n    \"domain\": 0,\n    \"tools\": 0,\n    \"location\": 0\n  },\n  \"match_level\": \"low | medium | high\",\n  \"strengths\": [],\n  \"gaps\": [],\n  \"recommendation\": \"reject | consider | strong_match\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
